{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"2be94c2ae9d8affa61e2f74676f36e0870b80cdde496fe2c50c491165f4d5760","ja":"不自然なひなた","zh":"不自然的日向","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e76e87041f080a7bcf705941dfffcdee08aff1cdb7e13528b2b3ecaef63e644d","ja":"翼、ひなた、のり子、紬の4人は\nトーク番組に出演していて……","zh":"翼、日向、法子、紬4人\n正在出演脱口秀节目……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4aae33774211f65ef2961790ad98481f64212ac7289973ad43bd8752fc97a475","ja":"「ゲストは『STARDOM ROAD』第六幕を盛り上げた\nみなさん。いやあ、今回も大人気だったようですね！」","zh":"“嘉宾是炒热了《STARDOM ROAD》第六幕气氛的\n各位。哎呀，这次似乎也大受欢迎呢！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"037b5b4cc209d63828bf3acd773d5411f05af8ba4615879bb981c239056f8d7e","ja":"主演の紬が、頑張ってましたから！　アタシたちも\n負けずに全力全開で、毎日稽古してたんですよ！","zh":"因为是主角的紬一直在努力嘛！我们也是\n不甘示弱地全力以赴，每天都在排练呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6643d72b86f191e4edf6124aa3747aff47abdc2f99012254b5f57844212398ec","ja":"そんな……私こそ、みなさんがいてくださったから\nこそ、クロエ役を無事やり遂げることができました。","zh":"怎么会……正因为有大家在，\n我才能顺利演完克洛艾这个角色。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c207441ae93f3ed61024b7239fa74985aa83a795c7bcd0789b0518e1168e253f","ja":"悩むこともありましたが、役と自分との共通点を\n掴めたことで、なんとか演じられたと思います。","zh":"虽然也曾有过烦恼，但好在抓住了角色与自己的\n共同点，总算是顺利演绎出来了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"215144c82fc4e6170c8f76f44936f2d2901b60a9ad59132fc10c14d99af30d09","ja":"わたしも、真珠星を見習って、\nけっこー頑張ってみたんですよ～。","zh":"我也向真珠星看齐，\n相当努力了呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"97bd579f50a1cd4f7dfa2f861751f569a531b7501ea7714cd15ee37035923feb","ja":"だから公演が終わったあとは、打ち上げで\n思いっきり遊んで、リフレッシュしちゃいました～！","zh":"所以演出结束之后，就在庆功宴上\n尽情玩耍，好好放松了一番～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"dc113b9b86be0225267832e52c21d8b58f6e0e42776621e4877211f4a45f8166","ja":"その時、あたし……あ、あーし？が食べた\nシャレオツなりんご飴が、すっげよくて！","zh":"那时候，我……啊，人家？吃的那个\n超潮的苹果糖，简直棒极了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"46cc1b56834e98b712bf3c588b29985d195476a775a548153b5bb1c6f4e729f3","ja":"それで気分アゲアゲ、って……\nな、なったんだよね！　い、いぇーい♪","zh":"然后就心情高涨……\n对、对吧！耶、耶——♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"f6e512a05ff2443974c1b02c69e94423ca81c6061899c32d74b365be2f83e1a3","ja":"えっ！？\nう、うん……？　そ、そうだね……？","zh":"咦！？\n嗯、嗯……？　是、是啊……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"1201eb1f4218685bffd35d872b4c97fc40b5dcb2704da6941549efc8b974c3cf","ja":"「あはは……？　えーっと。\nでは次は、この作品自体の見どころなどがあれば……」","zh":"「啊哈哈……？　那个。\n那么接下来，如果这部作品本身有什么看点的话……」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"955cd05254c25a3b4c4195ce9f40b3ecebbf58cecd97b04e2fb4a7e4d1d71349","ja":"そ、それは……やっぱり演技の違いかなって。\nあた……あーしたち、同じ役を演じてても……。","zh":"那、那个……大概还是演技上的区别吧。\n我……我们就算演的是同一个角色，也……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"3963b4b5aa645fddc43a440de3549d41b166a2f884438a96622a90a8116c89d3","ja":"個性が、自然とにじみ出てくるべ……くる、から。\nそういう所も、楽しんで、ねっ……。","zh":"个性会自然而然地流露出来……出来的。\n这一面，也请好好享受……哦……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"cb6a8f9d1b12cb827a2c709e030463d6100b001f1465673d0061ac9a4e28fdca","ja":"なんか……ひなたの様子、おかしくない？","zh":"总觉得……日向的样子是不是有点奇怪？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1478.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"0f4b77154e62ca34605c0d9eabdb9db309ba4e13f5bebad823a00364052aaa59","ja":"はい……。なんだか、\n無理に別人を演じようとしているような……？","zh":"是的……感觉好像是在\n勉强扮演一个完全不同的人……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
